{"id":"n5ea228eca9","headline":"What alternatives do Gulf states have to Strait of Hormuz?","summary":"Two months into the Iran war, the Strait of Hormuz is still mostly shut, with vessel traffic at a fraction of pre-war levels. Ceasefires, blockades and re-closures since February 28 have not restored confidence among tanker operators.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz is a key chokepoint for seaborne oil and LNG exports from the Gulf, so disruptions there directly affect global energy supply and prices.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Strait of Hormuz","country":"Oman","lat":26.567,"lon":56.25,"region":"me"},"entities":[{"name":"Brent crude","ticker":"BZ=F","kind":"company","sym":"BRENT","asset":{"id":"CM:BRENT","n":"Brent crude oil","c":"commodity","px":"BZ=F","la":57.5,"lo":1.5,"geo":"markets","site":"BRENT","m":"ticker-fixed","rv":"registry-v1"}}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Tribune","url":"https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/world/what-alternatives-do-gulf-states-have-to-strait-of-hormuz/"},"sources":[{"name":"The Tribune","url":"https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/world/what-alternatives-do-gulf-states-have-to-strait-of-hormuz/"}],"published_at":"2026-05-02T04:53:42Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T16:23:27Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"2789839b56e48630","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Continued restrictions on tanker traffic through the Strait of Hormuz keep concerns over Gulf oil supply elevated.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T16:23:27Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-05-02T04:53:42Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-05-02T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IR","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-3466030.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit"